em-pack">https://github.com/rasbt/local-coding-agent-evals/tree/main/agent-=
problem-pack</a><span>. This is basically an extension of the tasks from th=
e Local LLM Setup section.</span></p><p><span>The details on how to run the=
se are in the GitHub README: </span><a href=3D"https://github.com/rasbt/loc=
al-coding-agent-evals/tree/main/agent-problem-pack#quick-start-running-benc=
hmarks-manually">https://github.com/rasbt/local-coding-agent-evals/tree/mai=
