icle exceeding 5000 words), this would probably be a reasonable place to st=
op. However, as a bonus, I also thought it might be interesting to add brie=
f Codex and Claude Code notes for completeness.</p><p>Unfortunately, as far=
 as I know, the Codex UI does not support non-OpenAI models, but we can use=
